
@startuml
title User Registration - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "Registration Page" as Page
participant "Flask Application" as Flask
participant "Registration Form" as Form
database "Database" as DB

User -> Page: Open registration page
Page -> Flask: GET /register
Flask -> Page: Display registration form

User -> Page: Enter information and submit
Page -> Flask: POST /register
Flask -> Form: Validate form

alt Valid information
    Form --> Flask: Valid
    Flask -> DB: Check if email exists
    DB --> Flask: Email not found
    Flask -> Flask: Hash password
    Flask -> DB: Save new user
    DB --> Flask: User saved
    Flask -> Page: Redirect to login
    Page --> User: Registration successful
else Invalid information
    Form --> Flask: Validation failed
    Flask -> Page: Display form errors
    Page --> User: Correct information
end

@enduml
